Input: {"decision_time_ms": 1790600399999, "macro_contexts": {"D1": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790553599999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["Strongest counterargument: no follow-through above the 2850 high - the six bars since (1790035200000-1790553599999) overlap between 2641.37 and 2786.81 with lower highs, none closed above 2775.61, so the pattern is equally consistent with a final flag or a range-top probe rather than a confirmed breakout.", "The 21 bars from 1787356800000 to 1789430399999 are two-sided with repeated failures in 2530-2570 and deep pullbacks (-15% from 2771 to 2357.18; -12% from 2680 to 2358.62), which is trading-range behaviour rather than tight trend behaviour.", "More than half the window is sideways: 33 bars in 1512.91-1845.09 and about 35 bars in 1803.74-1974.46, so the bull-trend label rests on the post-1368.42 portion while the first seven bars of the window are a -32% bear spike.", "The 2357.18 and 2358.62 lows are a double bottom rather than a clearly higher low, so the latest leg's low does not advance the swing-low sequence."], "evidence_for": ["Swing progression is bullish after the 1368.42 low: higher swing lows 1368.42 to 1512.91 to 1803.74 to 2357.18 and higher swing highs 1845.09 to 1974.46 to 2771 to 2850.", "The widest and most decisive bars in the window are bull bars closing near their highs: 1787097600000 (1916.51 open, 2252.16 close, 2293.8 high) and 1789948800000 (2775.61 close, 2850 high).", "The most recent leg exceeded the 2771 spike high and set a new window high at 2850, and no bar after 1787270400000 closed below 2357.18.", "Follow-through within the recent leg: 1789689600000 closes 6.8% above its 2446.22 open, 1789776000000 closes 2632.98 near its high 2700, and the pause bars hold above 2633.31 rather than giving back the breakout."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["Window opens at 2021.3 (1780185600000) and closes at 2685.9 (1790553599999); window low is 1368.42 (1780704000000) and window high is 2850 (1789948800000).", "1780185600000-1780704000000 is a seven-bar bear spike: 2021.3 open to 1368.42 low (-32%), with wide bear bars closing near their lows (e.g. close 1581.32, close 1568.55).", "1780790400000-1782863999999: 33 overlapping bars held between 1512.91 (1782432000000) and 1845.09 (1781481600000), a two-sided base after the spike.", "1784073600000-1787011199999: about 35 bars between 1803.74 (1784246400000) and 1974.46 (1785110400000); the 1959.37/1974.46 highs were rejected (1785196800000 closed 1891.41) and many bars are small dojis.", "Bull breakout spike: 1787097600000 opens 1916.51 and closes 2252.16 (high 2293.8), 1787184000000 closes 2326.32, 1787270400000 reaches high 2771 and closes 2515.3 - three large bull bars out of the 1803.74-1974.46 range.", "1787356800000-1789430399999: 21 bars oscillate between 2357.18 (1788307200000) and 2680 (1789084800000, which closed back at 2514.72); most bars overlap and several ranges are under 100 points.", "1789430400000 low 2358.62 forms a near-equal double bottom with 2357.18, then four bars rise: 1789689600000 closes 2612.02, 1789776000000 closes 2632.98, 1789862400000 closes 2642.9, 1789948800000 closes 2775.61 with high 2850 above the 2771 swing high.", "Final six bars (1790035200000-1790553599999) close 2752.43, 2684.16, 2686.59, 2690.56, 2694.96, 2685.9, overlapping between 2641.37 and 2786.81 with lower highs; the last bar is a 50.28-point bear bar (2694.96/2718.83/2668.55/2685.9) closing in its lower half."], "phase": "breakout-spike", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Seven-bar selling climax / bear spike from the window open, with wide bear bars and a low 1368.42; price fell about 32% from the 2035.94 window-opening high.", "end_time_ms": 1780790399999, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1780185600000, "upper_boundary": "2035.94"}, {"description": "Post-climax two-sided base: 33 overlapping bars, repeated tests of the 1512-1560 area and of 1725-1845; no acceptance outside these extremes.", "end_time_ms": 1782863999999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "1512.91", "start_time_ms": 1780790400000, "upper_boundary": "1845.09"}, {"description": "Multi-week middle trading range; 1803.74-1974.46 boundaries tested repeatedly with rejections (1959.37, 1974.46) and many small-range/doji bars closing near the middle of the range.", "end_time_ms": 1787011199999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "1803.74", "start_time_ms": 1784073600000, "upper_boundary": "1974.46"}, {"description": "Three-bar bull spike breaking out of the 1803.74-1974.46 range: 1916.51 to 2252.16, then 2326.32, then a 2771 high; large bull bodies with closes in the upper half.", "end_time_ms": 1787270399999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "1905.63", "start_time_ms": 1787097600000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "Post-spike two-sided range: 21 bars between 2357.18 and a 2680 probe that closed back inside at 2514.72; repeated failures in 2530-2570 and a -15% pullback from 2771 to 2357.18.", "end_time_ms": 1789430399999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787356800000, "upper_boundary": "2680"}, {"description": "Bull leg from the 2357.18/2358.62 double bottom to a new window high 2850, with the 2771 prior spike high taken out; the leg contains large bull bars closing near their highs.", "end_time_ms": 1789948799999, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789430400000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Tight six-bar pause at the highs after the 2850 high: overlapping small bars, lower highs (2786.81 then 2718.83), holding above the 2641.37/2633.31 area.", "end_time_ms": 1790553599999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2641.37", "start_time_ms": 1790035200000, "upper_boundary": "2786.81"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["Bull confirmation: a bar closing above 2850 with its close in the upper third, or two consecutive closes above 2775.61, would confirm the breakout and strengthen the bull-trend/breakout-spike read.", "Breakout failure: a close back below about 2600, under the 1789689600000-1789776000000 congestion, or a strong bear bar closing near its low below 2633.31, would show the 2850 push lacked follow-through and return the read to a 2357.18-2850 trading range.", "Range break lower: consecutive closes below 2357.18 would break the double bottom and flip the structural read to a bear leg and downside range expansion.", "Continued overlap: further overlapping bars between 2641.37 and 2786.81 with no new high above 2850 and no close below 2633.31 keeps the phase a pause and leaves the regime unresolved at the top of the range."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "unclear", "always_in_relevance": "low", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790596799999, "directional_pressure": "balanced", "evidence_against": ["Medium-term swings still rise (low 2358.62 at 1789488000000 \u2192 low 2633.31 at 1790236800000; high 2609.02 at 1789416000000 \u2192 high 2850 at 1789977600000), and the last 39 bars have not broken a bull swing low, so the same bars can be read as a deep bull-flag pullback inside a bull trend.", "The range holds above the 2569.80-2586.68 pullback zone (bars 1789862400000-1789876800000) and above the 2604.31 midpoint of 2358.62-2850, so the leg's origin is intact and the structure is not confirmed as a top.", "Bar 1790582400000 (O 2645.21, L 2636.28, C 2667.86, H 2667.98) closes at the top of its range right after testing the range low, showing responsive buying at the low rather than acceptance below it.", "The declining highs 2850 \u2192 2786.81 \u2192 2740.42 \u2192 2718.83 combined with repeated tests of 2633.31 can equally be read as a lower-high/lower-low topping structure heading toward a bear leg, which the balanced/range label does not capture.", "The tight coil could be a continuation flag of the bull leg; a close above 2740.42 would invalidate the range read and re-establish the bull leg."], "evidence_for": ["Across the 24 bars 1790236800000-1790596799999 no close exceeds 2717.24 or falls below 2645.21; the 2740.42 high (1790323200000) is a lower high against 2850 and the 2633.31 low is retested at 2636.28 without a close beneath it \u2014 two-sided trade with neither side gaining acceptance.", "Bars 1790366400000-1790467200000 show ranges of 18.16, 14.43, 7.68, 15.90, 13.86, 11.84, 29.82 and 14.34 points with heavily overlapping bodies, a balance cluster rather than a trending sequence.", "The drop from the 2775.61 close high (1790020800000) to 2633.31 (1790236800000) is about 50% of the 2486.12-2850 leg, and the last close 2667.86 sits at that 50% level (2668.06); a retracement of that depth typically converts a bull leg into a trading range.", "Upside probes at 2700 (1789804800000, 1789948800000), 2850 (1789977600000) and 2740.42 (1790323200000) produced no follow-through, and highs since 1789977600000 decline 2850 \u2192 2786.81 \u2192 2740.42 \u2192 2718.83."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["120 closed H4 bars, first close 2497.60, last close 2667.86 (net +170.26); window low 2358.62 (bar 1789488000000) and window high 2850 (bar 1789977600000).", "Bar 1789128000000 (O 2457.12, H 2680, L 2444.19, C 2555.52) spiked above the early 2440-2520 balance, but bars 1789142400000-1789416000000 never closed above 2540.11 and the spike was fully retraced to 2358.62 (1789488000000).", "Bull sequence 1789732800000-1789992000000: closes 2578.60, 2636.28, 2638.49 with repeated highs of 2700 at bars 1789804800000 and 1789948800000, then bar 1789977600000 (O 2658.81, H 2850, L 2658.06, C 2723.15; range 191.94) closing 126.85 below its high.", "Highs since 1789977600000 decline: 2850, 2786.81 (1789977600000 and 1790136000000), 2740.42 (1790323200000), 2718.83 (1790496000000).", "Bars 1790366400000-1790467200000 have ranges of 18.16, 14.43, 7.68, 15.90, 13.86, 11.84, 29.82 and 14.34 points \u2014 a tight, heavily overlapping cluster near 2690.", "Range low 2633.31 (1790236800000) is retested at 2636.28 (1790582400000); no close since 1790236800000 is below 2645.21 (1790568000000) or above 2717.24 (1790481600000), and bar 1790582400000 (O 2645.21, L 2636.28, C 2667.86, H 2667.98) closes at the top of its range."], "phase": "range", "primary_regime": "trading-range", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Bull spike bar 1789128000000 (O 2457.12, H 2680, L 2444.19, C 2555.52) above the early 2440-2520 balance; not accepted \u2014 bars 1789142400000-1789416000000 stayed below 2609.02 and the spike was fully retraced to 2358.62 (1789488000000).", "end_time_ms": 1789502399999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789128000000, "upper_boundary": "2680"}, {"description": "Bull leg from the 2358.62 low (1789488000000) to the 2850 high (1789977600000): rounded base at 2384.29-2442.15 (1789502400000-1789588800000), then bull bars closing 2578.60 (1789732800000) and 2636.28 (1789747200000), with repeated 2700 highs at 1789804800000 and 1789948800000; strongest bars occur near the end of the leg.", "end_time_ms": 1789991999999, "kind": "channel", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789488000000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Wide bear-tailed bull bar 1789977600000 (O 2658.81, H 2850, L 2658.06, C 2723.15; range 191.94, upper tail 126.85) after the 2700 tests; subsequent bars 1789992000000-1790020800000 stalled at 2754.31-2775.61 without holding above 2740.", "end_time_ms": 1789991999999, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "2658.06", "start_time_ms": 1789977600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Two-legged pullback from 2850 (1789977600000) to 2633.31 (1790236800000), roughly half of the 2486.12-2850 leg (midpoint 2668.06); bear bars 1790164800000 (2726.71 to 2648.49) and 1790236800000 (2692.23 to 2633.31) drove the second leg.", "end_time_ms": 1790236799999, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "2633.31", "start_time_ms": 1789977600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Two-sided range from 1790236800000 to the decision bar: high 2740.42 (1790323200000) is a lower high versus 2850, low 2633.31 is retested at 2636.28 (1790582400000), closes stay inside 2645.21-2717.24, and bars 1790366400000-1790467200000 have ranges of only 7.68-29.82 points.", "end_time_ms": 1790596799999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2633.31", "start_time_ms": 1790236800000, "upper_boundary": "2740.42"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "H4", "transition_conditions": ["A close below 2633.31 followed by another close below that level would convert the range into a bear leg (lower high 2740.42 plus lower low) and shift the read toward transition/bear.", "A close above 2740.42 with follow-through beyond 2786.81 would break the declining-high sequence and support a bull-flag resolution of the range.", "Continued overlapping bars with sub-30-point ranges between 2633.31 and 2740.42 keep the range read and keep Always-In relevance low.", "A wide-range bar comparable to 1790164800000 (79.28 points) or 1789977600000 (191.94 points) with a same-direction follow-through close would indicate an accepted breakout; without follow-through within one to three bars (as after 1789128000000, the 2717.24 probe at 1790481600000 and the 2643.44 break at 1790553600000) the read returns to the range."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}}, "raw": {"H1": [{"close": "2714.8", "close_time_ms": 1790171999999, "high": "2722.14", "low": "2708.27", "open": "2719.63", "open_time_ms": 1790168400000, "volume": "2128922.964"}, {"close": "2676.14", "close_time_ms": 1790175599999, "high": "2722.14", "low": "2648.49